WEBVTT

00:06:28.333 --> 00:06:30.351
And you may be wondering --

00:06:30.375 --> 00:06:33.893
why are we interested
in these specific stores?

00:06:33.917 --> 00:06:36.059
We could have selected a store in the city

00:06:36.083 --> 00:06:40.184
where the electronic data could be
easily integrated into a data pipeline --

00:06:40.208 --> 00:06:43.059
cheap, convenient and easy.

00:06:43.083 --> 00:06:46.143
Why are we so obsessed with the quality

00:06:46.167 --> 00:06:49.143
and accuracy of the data
from these stores?

00:06:49.167 --> 00:06:50.726
The answer is simple:

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:54.000
because the data
from these rural stores matter.

00:06:55.708 --> 00:06:59.434
According to the International
Labour Organization,

00:06:59.458 --> 00:07:01.226
40 percent Chinese